  "description": "The Vaporesso Dojo Blast 2000 Go Prefilled Pod Kit delivers a seamless, long-lasting vaping experience in a compact and reusable design. Offering up to 2,000 puffs per kit, the Dojo Blast 2000 Go provides the ease of a disposable with the added convenience of swappable prefilled pods, making it a cost-effective and eco-conscious alternative. The 700mAh built-in battery ensures all-day reliability and can be recharged quickly via USB-C (cable sold separately). With a dual-pod system, each kit includes a 2ml prefilled pod and a 2ml refill container, giving you a total of 4ml of 20mg nic salt e-liquid for a smooth, satisfying mouth-to-lung (MTL) experience. Powered by COREX 2.0 Mesh Coil Technology, the Dojo Blast 2000 Go enhances flavour delivery, vapour consistency, and coil longevity. The inhale-activated, button-free design makes operation effortless—simply attach a pod and draw to vape. When a pod is depleted, easily swap it out for a fresh Dojo Blast 2000 Go Prefilled Pod+Refill Pack, available in a wide selection of 15 bold and exciting flavours. If you’d like to explore more devices like this, check out our full range of Prefilled Pod Vapes to find other convenient, high-quality kits and flavours. The Vaporesso Dojo Blast 2000 Go is the ideal choice for vapers seeking the ease of single-use disposables with the added benefit of a rechargeable device and swappable pods. Vaporesso Dojo Blast 2000 Go Kit Flavours • Apple Peach Crisp Apple meets juicy Peach. • Blue Razz Lemonade A vibrant mix of Blue Raspberry and zingy Lemonade. • Blueberry Sour Raspberry Tangy Blueberry with a sharp Raspberry kick. • Fizzy Cherry Sweet Cherry with a fizzy soda-like twist. • Kiwi Passionfruit Guava A tropical trio of exotic fruits. • Lemon Lime Bright citrus fusion of Lemon and Lime. • Menthol A classic, crisp Mint sensation. • Pineapple Ice Sweet, juicy Pineapple with an icy finish. • Pineapple Sunrise A tart tropical Pineapple medley. • Pink Lemonade A refreshing blend of fizzy Lemonade and mixed Berries. • Raspberry Lime Sweet Raspberry meets sharp Lime. • Strawberry Kiwi A luscious blend of Strawberry and zesty Kiwi. • Straw-Rasp Cherry Ice Strawberry, Raspberry, and Cherry with an icy exhale. • Triple Mango A bold, ripe Mango flavour experience. • Watermelon Ice Juicy Watermelon with a cool finish. How to Set Up Vaporesso Dojo Blast 2000 Go Step 1 Remove all packaging. Step 2 Remove the red silicone covers from the base and top of the refill pod. Step 3 Attach the 2ml pod to the 2ml refill. Step 4 Insert the combined pod into the Dojo Blast device, twisting to secure. Step 5 Inhale to vape — no buttons or setup required. ✅ Step 6 When finished, replace with a fresh pod + refill pack. Shop Vaporesso Dojo Blast 2000 Go Refill Pods Please note: Charging cable is not supplied. A USB-C cable can be purchased separately.",
